        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190589?u=f533e20910aae6e8ef669d6ccf02c94d3ca93d5c&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">webextensions.api.runtime.MessageSender.windowId</code>. Firefox 160 supports it. Safari has it in WebKit (not in a released build yet), so the entry is <code class=\"notranslate\">false</code> with the WebKit bug. Chrome is tracked in <a href=\"https://crbug.com/579968332\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://crbug.com/579968332</a>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">npm run lint -- webextensions</code> and Prettier pass.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Firefox: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/f43deb1ab6b2/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/f43deb1ab6b2\">mozilla-firefox/firefox@<tt>f43deb1ab6b2</tt></a> (Bug <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/commit/2072133d14b79eed448f4f1e50e64eb42689e3d4/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/commit/2072133d14b79eed448f4f1e50e64eb42689e3d4\"><tt>2072133</tt></a>, landed 2026-10-16)</li>\n<li>Safari: <a href=\"https://webkit.org/b/329185\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/b/329185</a> (325024@main, after the 323398@main…324653@main range of Safari Technology Preview 256)</li>\n<li>Proposal: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5360665662\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1077\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/1077/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1077\">w3c/webextensions#1077</a></li>\n<li>Orion release notes: <a href=\"https://orionbrowser.com/updates/orion-iOS-release-notes.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://orionbrowser.com/updates/orion-iOS-release-notes.html</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #31107.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6339028899\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31107\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31107/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31107\">#31107</a>.<br>\nRelated content PR: the MDN page for <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.MessageSender</code>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6338951852\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46480\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/46480/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46480\">mdn/content#46480</a>.</p>",
