        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45960703?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add data for <code class=\"notranslate\">alarms.create()</code> parameter <code class=\"notranslate\">AlarmCreateInfo.name</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">AlarmCreateInfo.persistAcrossSessions</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n<h5 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">name</code> argument</h5>\n<p dir=\"auto\">WECG discussion: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4477168389\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/999\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/999/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/999\">w3c/webextensions#999</a><br>\nSafari implementation commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/07565287df4a952e02a052d06125123d24ffcebd/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/07565287df4a952e02a052d06125123d24ffcebd\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>0756528</tt></a><br>\nChromium implementation commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/d458c841b34f246ebaeb05ed7a6687ba5d0028e6/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/d458c841b34f246ebaeb05ed7a6687ba5d0028e6\">chromium/chromium@<tt>d458c84</tt></a><br>\nWPT (upstreamed from Chromium) commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/9fe2a5b0d4b3827dd0d622eaa27344166f3d8204/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/9fe2a5b0d4b3827dd0d622eaa27344166f3d8204\">web-platform-tests/wpt@<tt>9fe2a5b</tt></a></p>\n<h5 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">persistAcrossSessions</code> argument</h5>\n<p dir=\"auto\">WECG discussion: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1747659821\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/406\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/406/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/406\">w3c/webextensions#406</a><br>\nChromium commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/900c2b00c42c377b93d3009372fa4f7f7d7e10cc/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/900c2b00c42c377b93d3009372fa4f7f7d7e10cc\">chromium/chromium@<tt>900c2b0</tt></a><br>\nChromium bug: <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40815223\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40815223</a><br>\nChromium documentation: <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/alarms\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/api/alarms</a><br>\nFirefox bug: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1995451\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1995451</a></p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5453402191\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45712\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45712/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45712\">mdn/content#45712</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6311571353\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46457\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/46457/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46457\">mdn/content#46457</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">WECG discussions:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1747659821\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/406\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/406/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/406\">w3c/webextensions#406</a><br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4477168389\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/999\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/999/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/999\">w3c/webextensions#999</a></p>\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31100",
