        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'd argue that we don't need to list all these constraints twice. Just once is enough and more maintainable.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Remove them from here: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MediaDevices/getSupportedConstraints#browser_compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MediaDevices/getSupportedConstraints#browser_compatibility</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Still have them here: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MediaStreamTrack/applyConstraints#browser_compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MediaStreamTrack/applyConstraints#browser_compatibility</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See the discussion in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5807528032\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46104\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/46104/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46104\">mdn/content#46104</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See also <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5499684694\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/issues/3391\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/3391/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/3391\">openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector#3391</a> which I plan to update to work with <code class=\"notranslate\">applyConstraints</code> instead, too.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31096",
            "title": "Remove list of constraints in getSupportedConstraints",
            "date_modified": "2026-11-12T11:28:11.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-11-10T14:17:40.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Adds the <code class=\"notranslate\">color_interpolation_method</code> subfeature for <code class=\"notranslate\">color-mix()</code> to track support for the optional <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;color-interpolation-method&gt;</code> argument.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Records support in Chrome 145, Firefox 147, and Safari 26.2, with implementation bug links.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #28693.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3741211856\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28693\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28693/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28693\">#28693</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31093",
            "title": "Add color-mix interpolation method support data",
            "date_modified": "2026-11-10T11:25:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-11-10T11:24:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "BHUVANSH855",
                "url": "https://github.com/BHUVANSH855"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190589?u=f533e20910aae6e8ef669d6ccf02c94d3ca93d5c&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds <code class=\"notranslate\">extensionTypes.IconVariant</code> and the <code class=\"notranslate\">variants</code> parameter of <code class=\"notranslate\">pageAction.setIcon()</code>, records the <code class=\"notranslate\">any</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">colorSchemes</code> properties, and adds the Firefox and Chrome bugs for the icon variants APIs.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">extensionTypes.IconVariant</code>: Safari 18.2. It is a dictionary type, so like <code class=\"notranslate\">ImageDetails</code> it describes the structure the APIs accept, and no browser exposes it on the <code class=\"notranslate\">extensionTypes</code> object.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">extensionTypes.IconVariant.any</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">icon_variants.any</code>: Safari 18.2, partial, because Safari prefers <code class=\"notranslate\">any</code> over every explicit size in a group instead of using it only when no other size is large enough: <a href=\"https://webkit.org/b/330501\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/b/330501</a>.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">extensionTypes.IconVariant.colorSchemes</code>: Safari 26.2, with <code class=\"notranslate\">color_schemes</code> as the alternative name from Safari 18.2.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">icon_variants.color_schemes</code> in the manifest: Safari 18.2.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">pageAction.setIcon()</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">variants</code>: Safari 18.2. Safari maps <code class=\"notranslate\">pageAction</code> onto the same implementation as <code class=\"notranslate\">action</code>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzil.la/1955199\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzil.la/1955199</a> is the Firefox <code class=\"notranslate\">impl_url</code> for the type and for the <code class=\"notranslate\">variants</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">iconVariants</code> parameters of <code class=\"notranslate\">action.setIcon()</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">browserAction.setIcon()</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">pageAction.setIcon()</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">menus.create()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">menus.update()</code>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://crbug.com/41419485\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://crbug.com/41419485</a> is the Chrome <code class=\"notranslate\">impl_url</code> for the type and for <code class=\"notranslate\">action.setIcon()</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">mdn_url</code> for the new type is left out until the MDN page exists.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">npm run lint -- webextensions</code> passes.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6174195138\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46364\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/46364/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46364\">mdn/content#46364</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3902842338\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/949\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/webextensions/issues/949/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/949\">w3c/webextensions#949</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Follows <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6174128428\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31029\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31029/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31029\">#31029</a> and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"6228958267\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31065\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31065/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31065\">#31065</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31072",
            "title": "Add extensionTypes.IconVariant and pageAction.setIcon variants, and the Firefox bug for the icon variants APIs.",
