            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Remaining bits to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5568937249\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30659\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30659/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30659\">#30659</a>. (Original PR author didn't seem to be responsive right now, so I didn't ask them to add it to their PR but instead sent this follow-up)</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31040",
            "title": "Chrome 152 removed Shared Storage API (remaining bits)",
            "date_modified": "2026-11-03T15:38:22.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-11-03T15:37:13.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
